  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-073-uri\\06_voice\\master\\short309_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Every grid keeps a list. It is called critical load, and it is the set of customers who do not get shed no matter what.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.641,
      "seconds": 6.641,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:459684012a77c5e51ba84adde6d8c54247a0b446a808dfe40015748e20dc0d02"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The obvious answers are on it. Hospitals. Water treatment. Emergency dispatch.",
      "start": 6.861,
      "end": 11.459,
      "seconds": 4.598,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:f5df34d88efd5f87b648b9fa4e98fd0487c39b7f8af4715d3a262ed80bfe0b7e"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Most natural gas production and processing facilities in Texas were not identified as critical load.",
      "start": 11.679,
      "end": 17.159,
      "seconds": 5.48,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:7d01af1ad86430956efb2f4b30a83dd21ddfc8b1912b6b8ed7d0b5e8720425fd"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "So when the operator shed twenty thousand megawatts to save the grid, some of what went dark was the gas industry that fuelled it.",
      "start": 17.379,
      "end": 24.159,
      "seconds": 6.78,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:07ace78c942cbcc7e4fdc33052f5bbe48f9fb03bd285ff87f95587fcc7351c60"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Compressor stations stopped. Processing plants stopped. Wells that needed power stopped. Which took fuel sources offline. Which forced further load shedding.",
      "start": 24.379,
      "end": 33.203,
      "seconds": 8.824,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:b003ddbc07510fc027912a2df0e0b4fc383a498f103f1ff51f454dbd88001d20"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The grid cut power to save itself, the power it cut fed the fuel system, the fuel system stopped, and the grid had to cut more.",
      "start": 33.423,
      "end": 40.993,
      "seconds": 7.57,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:06ddd64391eb5d6f35db621488aabbcfef9ba4926adfc4c5e3c84bdd426c8bce"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Nobody in that chain did anything wrong at the moment they did it. That is what makes it a loop and not a mistake.",
      "start": 41.213,
      "end": 47.343,
      "seconds": 6.13,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:7f95f87dccf1bde8a6accebf6207aa583acf572897aa46923e71c8dd745016f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Which is to say: somebody now has to keep the list that the gas fields were not on.",
      "start": 47.563,
      "end": 51.789,
      "seconds": 4.226,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:b98479598e6559a6f768bae496ead169de98e89a3ffb9188f926aac57ea8278b"
    }
  ]
}
